Herdr (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app)
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  - layouts/monokai-for-herdr.json is Herdr's defaults/layouts/main.json
    (0.1.13 to 0.1.14) with two keys added at its root: "theme": "monokai" and
    "preview": "layouts/monokai-for-herdr.svg". Nothing else is changed.
  - The colors Herdr derives from the themes/ files (panels, borders,
    agent statuses) follow Herdr's own rules in src/settings.rs.


Monokai

  The Monokai color scheme was created by Wimer Hazenberg in 2006.
  themes/monokai.json uses its original colors. It is not affiliated with
  or endorsed by Monokai or Monokai Pro, and takes nothing from Monokai Pro.


Visual Studio Code (https://github.com/microsoft/vscode)

  The terminal background, text and sidebar colors follow the Monokai
  theme built into Visual Studio Code (extensions/theme-monokai).
  themes/monokai-dimmed.json takes its colors from the Monokai Dimmed
  theme built into Visual Studio Code (extensions/theme-monokai-dimmed).

